	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Ut vobiscum, qui <placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName> sacris praeestis, familiaritatem amicamque iniret consuetudinem, charissime <lb xml:id="p1z2"/><persName ref="p495">Heinrice</persName>, invisit vos frater noster <persName ref="p3481">Sympertus Vogtius</persName> <placeName ref="l441">Schaffhusanus</placeName>, ecclesię <placeName ref="l49">Bielensis</placeName> minister, <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>homo et doctus et syncęrus.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Quare ut commode suo voto potiri possit, cum his diebus nobiscum <placeName ref="l41">Bernę</placeName> versaretur, <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>rem illi gratissimam feci, quod meis<note xml:id="fna" type="footnote" n="a"><hi>vor</hi> meis <hi>gestrichen</hi> tuis.</note> eum vobis commendarem litteris.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Id autem libentius fęci tua fretus <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>in omnes humanitate, maxime vero, qui nomine meo ad te veniunt, ut et is testis sit nostrę mutuae amicicię, quandoquidem <lb xml:id="p1z6"/><persName ref="p1391">Hallerum</persName> <persName ref="p495">Bullingero</persName> addictum omnes sic depraedicent, ut totus ab eo pendeat, quantum citra fidei et sanę doctrinę <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>iacturam hoc licet.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Ceterum antidotum in nostram comparavimus bibliothecam<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Gemeint ist wahrscheinlich der Kampf gegen Ungeziefer, Holz- und Bücherwürmer in der Bibliothek [des Ministeriums?] in <placeName ref="l41">Bern</placeName>.</note>; tuo igitur, quantum unquam per ocium licet, <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>consilio obsequar.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Proscribetur <placeName ref="l832">Gallus</placeName> <persName ref="p7242">Claudius</persName><note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2"><persName ref="p7242">Claude d'Aliod</persName>, vgl. oben S. 158, 86-97 und 171,3-22.</note> etiam <persName ref="p3481">Symperto</persName><note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3"><persName ref="p3481">Simprecht Vogt</persName>.</note> optime notus; interim opus est, ut parati simus <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>in omnibus rationem reddere eius, quae in nos est spei<note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>1 Petr 3, 15</ref></cit>.</note>.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Nova <placeName ref="l572">Wirtenbergica</placeName><note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5">Gemeint sind die von <persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName> an <persName ref="p1391">Haller</persName> zugesandten Nachrichten vom siegreichen Krieg zur Wiedereinsetzung Herzog <persName ref="p9708">Ulrichs von Württemberg</persName>, vgl. unten S. 195, 3f.</note> placent, placet et hoc, quod addidisti<note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6"><persName ref="p495">Bullingers</persName> Brief an <persName ref="p1391">Haller</persName> ist nicht erhalten.</note>, <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>quatenus in timore domini omnia suscipiamus<note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" n="7">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>Spr 1,7</ref></cit> u. a.</note>, ne «extrema gaudii nostri luctus occupet» <cit type="bible"><ref>[Spr 14, 13]</ref></cit>.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Apud nos nihil est, quod scitu <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>dignum videatur.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Valemus alioqui omnes.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Valeas et tu, charissime frater, et me, ut soles, ama.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l41">Bernę</placeName>, 21. <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>maii anno 34.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z13"/>Tuus <persName ref="p1391">B. Hallerus</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse auf der Rückseite:]</note>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/><persName ref="p495">Heinrico Bullingero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>ecclesias<lb xml:id="p2z3"/>tę <placeName ref="l587">Tigurino</placeName>, fratri <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>suo charissimo.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
